    "en": {
      "trackName": "Search Mines Wear - Watch game",
      "description": "Search for mines in this minimal game for iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch.\n\nThe game consists in clearing all the squares, circles and triangles that don't hide a mine. The boxes have a number, which indicates the number of mines in the adjacent cells. Tap carefully; one wrong move and it’s game over!\n\nAPPLE WATCH LEVELS (Optimized for your wrist):\n- Easy: 6x6 / 7x7 grid with 3 mines. Perfect for a quick break.\n- Normal: 6x6 / 7x7 grid with 6 mines. Test your logic.\n- Hard: 6x6 / 7x7 grid with 10 mines. Only for experts!\n\nIPHONE & IPAD LEVELS:\n- Easy: 5×5 grid & 3 mines\n- Normal: 8×8 grid & 10 mines\n- Hard: 10×10 grid & 20 mines\n- Extreme: 15×15 grid & 80 mines\n- Custom: Design and configure your own board manually!\n\nLet's play with the Apple Watch!",
      "releaseNotes": "- Updated dependences",
